      "title": "Preprocessing and Evaluation for Support Request Classification",
      "bullets": [
        "Implemented assigned text normalization and label mapping routines for support requests, following existing preprocessing specifications and documenting ambiguous category assignments.",
        "Ran prescribed classification experiments using term frequency–inverse document frequency features and logistic regression, inspecting confusion matrices for recurring category errors."
      ]
